  },
  "body": "Hello!\n\nWith pytest version 9.0.0 we can finally just write `[tool.pytest]` instead of `[tool.pytest.ini_options]` in a `pyproject.toml` file but I think there are quite a lot of people who use VS Code with this nice extension https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=tamasfe.even-better-toml which does not yet know about this change and will mark `[tool.pytest]` as an error.\n\nThis has to be added to SchemaStore, see https://github.com/SchemaStore/schemastore/issues/3564 so consider this just a kind of PSA and also a hint for people who came here via a websearch.",
